{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\nSentence: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n原句: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\nYou are answering inside a small lookup panel: keep it under 60 words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n当前在查词面板中, 请控制在80字以内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    " (built-in)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " (内置)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (%@)": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ (%lld)": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ - read novels and magazines in a foreign language with tap-to-look-up, MDict dictionaries, translation, notes and vocabulary review. Give it a try!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ - 让你轻松读懂英文小说、外刊杂志, 支持单击查词、mdict字典、翻译、做笔记、背单词等功能! 你也快来试试吧~"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Configuration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@引擎配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ configuration cleared": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已清除%@配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ configured": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已成功配置%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ does not provide any books. The third-party sources listed here are publicly available on the internet and their availability is not guaranteed. You can add your own OPDS, WebDAV or web sources.\n1. Tap to browse.  2. Long-press to make a source open by default in the Library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 不包含任何图书源, App中的第三方图书源均收集于网络，本App不保证第三方图书源的可用性。用户可以自定义图书源, 支持OPDS、WebDav、网页图书源。\n1. 单击在线浏览;  2. 长按可将图书源设置为书库默认打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ does not provide any books. Third-party sources are publicly available on the internet. OPDS, WebDAV and web sources are supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 不包含任何图书源, 第三方图书源均收集于网络。支持 OPDS、WebDav、网页图书源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
