    "A book's language can be changed at the top right of its Vocabulary Profile. Level highlighting supports English, French and Spanish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "书籍语言可在 词汇透析 页面右上角修改, 支持英语、法语、西班牙语的分级词汇高亮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A group with this name already exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图书分组已存在, 请重新修改分组名~"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A TED talk every day": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天一个 TED 演讲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A → Z": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按字母升序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A1/A2 beginner, B1/B2 intermediate (IELTS 5.5–6.5 ≈ B2), C1/C2 advanced (IELTS 7+). Recommended books have high vocabulary coverage at your level, so they won't feel too hard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A1/A2 入门, B1/B2 中级 (四六级约 B1-B2, 雅思 5.5-6.5 约 B2), C1/C2 高级 (雅思 7 分以上)。推荐的书在你的水平下词汇覆盖率较高, 读起来不会太吃力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A1/A2 beginner, B1/B2 intermediate (TCF/TEF for immigration usually requires about B2), C1/C2 advanced. Recommended books have high vocabulary coverage at your level; 95%+ coverage reads fluently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A1/A2 入门, B1/B2 中级 (TCF/TEF 移民一般要求 B2 左右), C1/C2 高级。推荐的书在你的水平下词汇覆盖率较高, 读起来不会太吃力; 覆盖率 95% 以上较为流畅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
