            "value": "webdav账户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the center button is green, tap words to look them up or translate. Red means browse mode, where taps follow links normally. Tap the button to switch modes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加载完毕, 中心按钮背景变为绿色时可单击查词、翻译等; 红色时表示为浏览模式, 不可单击查词等; 点击按钮切换模式!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which exam are you preparing for?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您将要参加的外语考试是?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Dictionary Transfer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WiFi 传字典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi is not available. Connect to Wi-Fi and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WLAN服务未开启, 请连接WiFi后重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Transfer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WiFi 传书"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your own key, only the provider's quota applies; the app doesn't limit translations. Long-press and drag to set priority.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置翻译平台key之后每月的翻译限额为平台限额, App不再限制翻译次数，长按拖动可进行优先级排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a configured engine, iOS system translation is used (works offline once languages are downloaded).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未配置翻译引擎时使用系统翻译 (iOS 翻译, 可下载语言后离线使用)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word Levels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单词分级"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word levels highlighted while reading": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阅读时高亮显示的词汇等级(考研词汇等)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word Prompt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单词指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words at the selected levels are highlighted when you read books in that language, so you learn vocabulary as you read. French TCF/TEF levels follow the CEFR (A1–C2).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择之后, 阅读对应语言的书籍时这些等级的词汇会高亮显示, 便于在阅读中学习单词! 法语 TCF/TEF 按欧洲语言框架 A1-C2 分级。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words only, one per line, for importing into other flashcard apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅包含单词(每行一个), 便于导入到第三方背单词App里!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a note…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加阅读笔记~"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yandex Disk (10 GB free): sign in with an app password generated in Yandex ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yandex Disk (免费10GB): 需使用 Yandex ID 中生成的应用密码登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are a language teacher helping the user learn a foreign language while reading. Keep answers short: get straight to the point, with no headings, pleasantries or follow-up questions, usually under 80 words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是一个外语老师，帮助用户在阅读中学习外语。回答要简短: 直接给出要点，不要标题、不要客套话、不要追问，一般不超过120字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can find a show's RSS feed on Apple Podcasts and similar platforms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在 Apple 播客等平台找到节目的 RSS 地址"
