    "“%@…”": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "“For You” is based on your %@ level set on the Discover tab. Synced subtitles appear during playback: the show's own transcript is used when available, otherwise one is generated on device. Tap a word to look it up, or tap a line to jump to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「适合你」依据「推荐」页中设置的%@水平。播放时自动显示同步字幕: 节目自带字幕时直接使用, 否则在本机离线识别生成。点击字幕中的单词即可查词, 点击句子跳转播放。"
          }
        }
      }
